:4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-02-26T02:34:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T20:30:17Z","closed_at":"2025-02-27T00:13:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.4.rc.custom_build [01545c995] and previous versions (I remember encountering this issue before and finding workarounds for it)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc (01545c995) - macOS Sequoia (15.3.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon Pro 5500 XT OpenGL Engine - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700K CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a GPUParticles2D system emits for the first time by setting `emitting` to `true`, there is a very brief but noticeable pause in the game execution. When `emitting` is set to `true` on subsequent times, the pause does not occur.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb77c9ee-ef28-4552-aa37-bd1469cad0f6\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a GPUParticles2D node, and set it to be a one-shot system.\n2. In a script, set its `emitting` property to `true`. There will be a brief pause/stutter.\n3. Set its `emitting` property to `true` again, after it has finished emitting. There will not be a pause this time.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gamefreezesonparticles_2025-02-25_18-27-14.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18975900/gamefreezesonparticles_2025-02-25_18-27-14.zip)\n\nWhen running this project, press the Enter/Return key to make a particle emit in the center of the screen. The first time, there should be a very brief pause; on subsequent times, there shouldn't be a pause.","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}